        "text": "Parcel size must match weight: A (≤5,000 g), B (5,001–15,000 g), C (15,001–25,000 g); mismatch returns 422 SIZE_WEIGHT_MISMATCH.",
        "owner": "provider"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/decisions/-",
      "value": {
        "id": "D8",
        "text": "Receiver phone must be UK mobile in E.164 format (+447 followed by 9 digits); otherwise 422 INVALID_PHONE.",
        "owner": "provider"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/decisions/-",
      "value": {
        "id": "D9",
        "text": "Postcode must be uppercase with exactly one space matching pattern ^[A-Z]{1,2}\\d[A-Z\\d]? \\d[A-Z]{2}$; otherwise 422 INVALID_POSTCODE.",
        "owner": "provider"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/decisions/-",
      "value": {
        "id": "D10",
        "text": "Postcode area (first 1-2 letters) must match the city (e.g., SW1A 1AA → London); mismatch returns 422 POSTCODE_CITY_MISMATCH.",
        "owner": "provider"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/decisions/-",
      "value": {
        "id": "D11",
        "text": "Only country code 'GB' is accepted; any other value returns 400 INVALID_REQUEST.",
        "owner": "provider"
      }
