{
  "message": "Spokes consumer here. Round 9 by parcelly correctly notes we still lack consumer scenarios (S1, S2, ...) and end-to-end scenarios (E1, ...). I'll add those now, plus fix the duplicate decision ID H7-2 that appeared twice in v14 decisions. After this, the contract should have all required scenarios for signing.",
