        "id": "D3",
        "text": "Parcel size must match weight: A (≤5,000g), B (5,001–15,000g), C (15,001–25,000g). Mismatch returns 422 SIZE_WEIGHT_MISMATCH.",
        "owner": "provider"
      }
    },
