        "id": "D9",
        "text": "Idempotency keys are scoped per partner (partner_id:key). Blank or missing Idempotency-Key header means no idempotency. Keys of 4xx responses are not stored. Keys longer than 255 chars return 400 INVALID_IDEMPOTENCY_KEY.",
        "owner": "provider"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/decisions/-",
