  advance via sandbox -> expects 200
  then await app.locals.parcelly.webhooks.idle();

But the webhook dispatcher only dispatches when status transition is allowed. For RETURNED, allowed transitions are only from IN_TRANSIT to RETURNED. However we are advancing from CREATED to RETURNED directly? Let's see: create shipment sets status CREATED. Then advance to RETURNED. According to D5, webhook only emitted for genuine status transitions: CREATED→COLLECTED, COLLECTED→IN_TRANSIT, IN_TRANSIT→DELIVERED, IN_TRANSIT→RETURNED. So CREATED→RETURNED is not allowed, thus no webhook dispatched. That's why zero deliveries.

