Thus the test is wrong? But we cannot modify existing tests. However the test is part of the repository; we must keep existing repository tests passing. So we need to make the test pass while still adhering to contract? Possibly the test expects that advancing to RETURNED from CREATED is not a valid transition and therefore no webhook, but they still expect retries? That doesn't make sense.

